{"slug":"/students/zdfxfbfvd/","source":"students/zdfxfbfvd.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Mathematics - Quadratic Equation","description":"","subject":null,"body":"<div class=\"flex flex-col min-h-screen\">\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"bg-white shadow-sm sticky top-0 z-40\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                    <a href=\"/students/subjects/\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -arrow-left\" data-mi=\"arrow_back\">arrow_back</span>\n                        <span class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Mastering Quadratic Equations</span>\n                    </a>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">\n                            <span>Progress:</span>\n                            <div class=\"w-32 bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-2.5 inline-block ml-2\">\n                                <div class=\"bg-blue-600 h-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 0%\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <img src=\"/site/assets/images/logo.png\" alt=\"logo\" class=\"h-10 w-auto\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Main Content -->\n        <main class=\"flex-grow max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 w-full\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\">\n                <!-- Left Sidebar: Learning Steps -->\n                <aside class=\"lg:col-span-1\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-sm sticky top-24\">\n                        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg mb-4\">Tools</h3>\n                        <p>Sub-topics</p>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-2\">\n                            <li><a href=\"#solving\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-2 rounded-md hover:bg-blue-50 text-gray-700 font-medium\"><span class=\"mi -calculator w-5 text-center text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span><span>Solving Equations</span></a></li>\n                            <li><a href=\"#forming\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-2 rounded-md hover:bg-blue-50 text-gray-700 font-medium\"><span class=\"mi -cogs w-5 text-center text-green-500\" data-mi=\"settings\">settings</span><span>Forming &amp; Applications</span></a></li>\n                            <li><a href=\"#graphs\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-2 rounded-md hover:bg-blue-50 text-gray-700 font-medium\"><span class=\"mi -chart-line w-5 text-center text-purple-500\" data-mi=\"show_chart\">show_chart</span><span>Graphs &amp; Functions</span></a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                        <p>Resources</p>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-2\">\n                            <li><a href=\"#resources\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-2 rounded-md hover:bg-blue-50 text-gray-700 font-medium\"><span class=\"mi -robot w-5 text-center text-green-500\" data-mi=\"smart_toy\">smart_toy</span><span>Interactive Solver</span></a></li>\n                            <li><a href=\"#resources\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-2 rounded-md hover:bg-blue-50 text-gray-700 font-medium\"><span class=\"mi -project-diagram w-5 text-center text-purple-500\" data-mi=\"schema\">schema</span><span>Graph Visualizer</span></a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </aside>\n\n                <!-- Right Content Area -->\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-3\">\n                    <div class=\"space-y-8\" id=\"learning-content\">\n                        <!-- Section 1: Solving Quadratic Equations -->\n                        <div id=\"solving\" data-step=\"0\" class=\"learning-step bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm p-6 scroll-mt-24\">\n                            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\"><span class=\"mi -calculator text-blue-500 mr-3\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>Solving Quadratic Equations</h2>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6\">A quadratic equation is any equation that can be written as <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100 p-1 rounded text-sm\">ax² + bx + c = 0</code>. \"Solving\" it means finding the values of 'x' that make the equation true. Let's explore the common methods.</p>\n                            \n                            <div class=\"space-y-4\" id=\"solving-methods\">\n                                <!-- Accordion Item: Factorization -->\n                                <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg\">\n                                  <button class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-center p-4 text-left font-semibold text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                                    <span>a. Solution by Factorization</span>\n                                    <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n                                  </button>\n                                  <div class=\"p-4 pt-0 text-gray-600 text-sm hidden\">\n                                    <p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>The Big Idea:</strong> Rewrite the equation as a product of two simple expressions (factors) that equal zero. If a product of two things is zero, one (or both) of them must be zero.</p>\n                                    <p><strong>Example:</strong> Solve <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x² - 5x + 6 = 0</code></p>\n                                    <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside mt-2 space-y-1\">\n                                      <li><strong>Multiply:</strong> Multiply 6 by the coefficient of x² ( coefficient is the number in front of a variable (letter)). In this case the coefficient of x² is 1. Multiplying +6 by 1 we have +6.</li>\n                                      <li><strong>Think:</strong> What two numbers can you multiply to give `+6` and add to give `-5`? The numbers are `-2` and `-3`.</li>\n                                      <li><strong>Rewrite:</strong> Use these numbers to create two factors: <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">(x - 2)(x - 3) = 0</code>.</li>\n                                      <li><strong>Solve:</strong> Now, either <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x - 2 = 0</code> or <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x - 3 = 0</code>.</li>\n                                      <li><strong>Result:</strong> The roots are <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x = 2</code> and <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x = 3</code>.</li>\n                                    </ol>\n                                    \n                                    <!-- Interactive Quiz Start -->\n                                    <div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-dashed\">\n                                        <button id=\"start-quiz-btn\" class=\"w-full flex justify-center items-center gap-2 p-2 bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800 font-semibold rounded-md hover:bg-yellow-200 transition\">\n                                            <span class=\"mi -pencil-alt\" data-mi=\"edit\">edit</span>\n                                            <span>Try a Practice Problem</span>\n                                        </button>\n                                        <div id=\"quiz-container\" class=\"hidden mt-4 space-y-4\" data-bidemy=\"quiz\">\n                                            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800\">Solve by Factorization: <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x² + 7x + 10 = 0</code></h4>\n                                            \n                                            <!-- Step 1 -->\n                                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-step=\"1\">\n                                                <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Answer...\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\">\n                                                <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-300 text-sm\">Check</button>\n                                                <p class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-48 text-xs text-gray-500\"><strong>Multiply:</strong> Multiply 'c' (10) by the coefficient of x² (1).</p>\n                                                <span class=\"feedback-icon\"></span>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <!-- Step 2 -->\n                                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-step=\"2\">\n                                                <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g., 4, 9\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\">\n                                                <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-300 text-sm\">Check</button>\n                                                <p class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-48 text-xs text-gray-500\"><strong>Think:</strong> What two numbers multiply to 10 and add to 7?</p>\n                                                <span class=\"feedback-icon\"></span>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <!-- Step 3 -->\n                                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-step=\"3\">\n                                                <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g., (x+4)(x+9)=0\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\">\n                                                <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-300 text-sm\">Check</button>\n                                                <p class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-48 text-xs text-gray-500\"><strong>Rewrite:</strong> Use the numbers to create two factors.</p>\n                                                <span class=\"feedback-icon\"></span>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <!-- Step 4 -->\n                                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-step=\"4\">\n                                                <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g., x+4=0 or x+9=0\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\">\n                                                <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-300 text-sm\">Check</button>\n                                                <p class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-48 text-xs text-gray-500\"><strong>Solve:</strong> Set each factor to zero.</p>\n                                                <span class=\"feedback-icon\"></span>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <!-- Step 5 -->\n                                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-step=\"5\">\n                                                <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g., x=1, x=-4\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\">\n                                                <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-300 text-sm\">Check</button>\n                                                <p class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-48 text-xs text-gray-500\"><strong>Result:</strong> State the final roots.</p>\n                                                <span class=\"feedback-icon\"></span>\n                                            </div>\n\n                                            <!-- Independent Practice Quiz Start -->\n                                            <div class=\"mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-dashed\">\n                                                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800\">Independent Practice</h4>\n                                                <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-3\">Now, solve this one on your own. Show your steps and provide the final answer.</p>\n                                                <p class=\"font-semibold\">Problem: <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x² - 8x + 15 = 0</code></p>\n                                                \n                                                <div id=\"independent-quiz\" class=\"mt-4 space-y-3\">\n                                                    <div>\n                                                        <label for=\"workings\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Your Workings</label>\n                                                        <textarea id=\"workings\" rows=\"5\" class=\"w-full mt-1 p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\" placeholder=\"Show your steps here...\n1. Find two numbers that multiply to 15 and add to -8.\n2. Rewrite the equation with factors.\n3. Set each factor to zero.\n4. State the final roots.\"></textarea>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                    <div>\n                                                        <label for=\"final-answer\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Final Answer</label>\n                                                        <input type=\"text\" id=\"final-answer\" placeholder=\"e.g., x=3, x=5\" class=\"w-full mt-1 p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\">\n                                                    </div>\n                                                    <button id=\"check-independent-answer\" class=\"w-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-blue-700 transition\">Check Final Answer</button>\n                                                    <div id=\"independent-feedback\" class=\"text-sm mt-2\"></div>\n                                                </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <!-- Independent Practice Quiz End -->\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <!-- Interactive Quiz End -->\n                                  </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!-- Accordion Item: Completing the Square -->\n                                <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg\">\n                                  <button class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-center p-4 text-left font-semibold text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                                    <span>b. Solution by Completing the Square</span>\n                                    <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n                                  </button>\n                                  <div class=\"p-4 pt-0 text-gray-600 text-sm hidden\">\n                                    <p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>The Big Idea:</strong> Force one side of the equation to become a \"perfect square\" trinomial, like <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">(x+p)²</code>. Think of it as adding the \"missing piece\" to build a perfect square.</p>\n                                    <p><strong>Example:</strong> Solve <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x² + 6x - 7 = 0</code></p>\n                                    <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside mt-2 space-y-1\">\n                                      <li><strong>Isolate:</strong> Move the constant term to the other side: <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x² + 6x = 7</code>.</li>\n                                      <li><strong>Find the \"Missing Piece\":</strong> Take half of the 'x' coefficient (6/2 = 3) and square it (3² = 9). This is the piece needed to \"complete the square\".</li>\n                                      <li><strong>Add to Both Sides:</strong> Add 9 to both sides to keep the equation balanced: <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x² + 6x + 9 = 7 + 9</code>.</li>\n                                      <li><strong>Factor and Simplify:</strong> The left side is now a perfect square: <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">(x + 3)² = 16</code>.</li>\n                                      <li><strong>Solve:</strong> Take the square root of both sides: <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x + 3 = ±4</code>. This gives two possibilities: <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x+3=4</code> (so x=1) and <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x+3=-4</code> (so x=-7).</li>\n                                    </ol>\n                                    <!-- Interactive Quiz Start -->\n                                    <div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-dashed\">\n                                    <button id=\"start-quiz-btn-square\" class=\"w-full flex justify-center items-center gap-2 p-2 bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800 font-semibold rounded-md hover:bg-yellow-200 transition\">\n                                      <span class=\"mi -pencil-alt\" data-mi=\"edit\">edit</span>\n                                      <span>Try a Practice Problem</span>\n                                    </button>\n                                    <div id=\"quiz-container-square\" class=\"hidden mt-4 space-y-4\">\n                                      <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800\">Complete the Square: <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x² + 4x - 5 = 0</code></h4>\n                                      <!-- Step 1 -->\n                                      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-step-square=\"1\">\n                                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g., x² + 4x = 5\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\">\n                                        <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-300 text-sm\">Check</button>\n                                        <p class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-48 text-xs text-gray-500\"><strong>Isolate:</strong> Move the constant to the other side.</p>\n                                        <span class=\"feedback-icon\"></span>\n                                      </div>\n                                      <!-- Step 2 -->\n                                      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-step-square=\"2\">\n                                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g., 2² = 4\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\">\n                                        <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-300 text-sm\">Check</button>\n                                        <p class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-48 text-xs text-gray-500\"><strong>Find the 'Missing Piece':</strong> (Half of 4, squared)</p>\n                                        <span class=\"feedback-icon\"></span>\n                                      </div>\n                                      <!-- Step 3 -->\n                                      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-step-square=\"3\">\n                                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g., x² + 4x + 4 = 5 + 4\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\">\n                                        <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-300 text-sm\">Check</button>\n                                        <p class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-48 text-xs text-gray-500\"><strong>Add to Both Sides:</strong> Add the missing piece to both sides.</p>\n                                        <span class=\"feedback-icon\"></span>\n                                      </div>\n                                      <!-- Step 4 -->\n                                      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-step-square=\"4\">\n                                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g., (x+2)² = 9\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\">\n                                        <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-300 text-sm\">Check</button>\n                                        <p class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-48 text-xs text-gray-500\"><strong>Factor and Simplify:</strong> Write as a perfect square.</p>\n                                        <span class=\"feedback-icon\"></span>\n                                      </div>\n                                      <!-- Step 5 -->\n                                      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-step-square=\"5\">\n                                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g., x+2=±3\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\">\n                                        <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-300 text-sm\">Check</button>\n                                        <p class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-48 text-xs text-gray-500\"><strong>Solve:</strong> Take the square root of both sides.</p>\n                                        <span class=\"feedback-icon\"></span>\n                                      </div>\n                                      <!-- Step 6 -->\n                                      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-step-square=\"6\">\n                                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g., x=1, x=-5\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\">\n                                        <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-300 text-sm\">Check</button>\n                                        <p class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-48 text-xs text-gray-500\"><strong>Result:</strong> State the final roots.</p>\n                                        <span class=\"feedback-icon\"></span>\n                                      </div>\n                                      <!-- Independent Practice Quiz Start -->\n                                      <div class=\"mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-dashed\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800\">Independent Practice</h4>\n                                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-3\">Now, solve this one on your own. Show your steps and provide the final answer.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"font-semibold\">Problem: <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x² + 10x + 16 = 0</code></p>\n                                        <div id=\"independent-quiz-square\" class=\"mt-4 space-y-3\">\n                                          <div>\n                                            <label for=\"workings-square\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Your Workings</label>\n                                            <textarea id=\"workings-square\" rows=\"5\" class=\"w-full mt-1 p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\" placeholder=\"Show your steps here...\\n1. Move the constant to the other side.\\n2. Find the missing piece.\\n3. Add to both sides.\\n4. Write as a perfect square.\\n5. Take the square root.\\n6. State the final roots.\"></textarea>\n                                          </div>\n                                          <div>\n                                            <label for=\"final-answer-square\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Final Answer</label>\n                                            <input type=\"text\" id=\"final-answer-square\" placeholder=\"e.g., x=-2, x=-8\" class=\"w-full mt-1 p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\">\n                                          </div>\n                                          <button id=\"check-independent-answer-square\" class=\"w-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-blue-700 transition\">Check Final Answer</button>\n                                          <div id=\"independent-feedback-square\" class=\"text-sm mt-2\"></div>\n                                        </div>\n                                      </div>\n                                      <!-- Independent Practice Quiz End -->\n                                    </div>\n                                  </div>\n                                  <!-- Interactive Quiz End -->\n                                </div>\n                                <!-- Accordion Item: Formula -->\n                                <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg\">\n                                  <button class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-center p-4 text-left font-semibold text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                                    <span>c. Solution by Formula</span>\n                                    <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n                                  </button>\n                                  <div class=\"p-4 pt-0 text-gray-600 text-sm hidden\">\n                                    <p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>The Big Idea:</strong> A universal formula that works for any quadratic equation. Just plug in the 'a', 'b', and 'c' values.</p>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-2 rounded-lg text-center text-md font-mono text-gray-800 mt-2\">x = [ -b ± sqrt(b² - 4ac) ] / 2a</div>\n                                    <div class=\"mt-4 bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-400 p-3\">\n                                      <h4 class=\"font-semibold\">The Discriminant (b² - 4ac)</h4>\n                                      <p>This part of the formula tells you the <strong>nature of the roots</strong> (i.e., how many solutions you'll get):</p>\n                                      <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside pl-2 mt-1\">\n                                        <li>If it's <strong>positive</strong>, you get <strong>two different real roots</strong>.</li>\n                                        <li>If it's <strong>zero</strong>, you get <strong>one repeated real root</strong>.</li>\n                                        <li>If it's <strong>negative</strong>, you get <strong>two complex roots</strong> (no real solutions).</li>\n                                      </ul>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <!-- Interactive Quiz Start -->\n                                    <div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-dashed\">\n                                    <button id=\"start-quiz-btn-formula\" class=\"w-full flex justify-center items-center gap-2 p-2 bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800 font-semibold rounded-md hover:bg-yellow-200 transition\">\n                                      <span class=\"mi -pencil-alt\" data-mi=\"edit\">edit</span>\n                                      <span>Try a Practice Problem</span>\n                                    </button>\n                                    <div id=\"quiz-container-formula\" class=\"hidden mt-4 space-y-4\">\n                                      <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800\">Solve by Formula: <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x² - 2x - 8 = 0</code></h4>\n                                      <!-- Step 1 -->\n                                      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-step-formula=\"1\">\n                                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g., a=1, b=-2, c=-8\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\">\n                                        <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-300 text-sm\">Check</button>\n                                        <p class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-48 text-xs text-gray-500\"><strong>Identify:</strong> State the values of a, b, and c.</p>\n                                        <span class=\"feedback-icon\"></span>\n                                      </div>\n                                      <!-- Step 2 -->\n                                      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-step-formula=\"2\">\n                                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g., (-2)² - 4*1*(-8) = 36\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\">\n                                        <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-300 text-sm\">Check</button>\n                                        <p class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-48 text-xs text-gray-500\"><strong>Discriminant:</strong> Calculate b² - 4ac.</p>\n                                        <span class=\"feedback-icon\"></span>\n                                      </div>\n                                      <!-- Step 3 -->\n                                      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-step-formula=\"3\">\n                                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g., x = [2 ± sqrt(36)]/2\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\">\n                                        <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-300 text-sm\">Check</button>\n                                        <p class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-48 text-xs text-gray-500\"><strong>Substitute:</strong> Plug into the formula.</p>\n                                        <span class=\"feedback-icon\"></span>\n                                      </div>\n                                      <!-- Step 4 -->\n                                      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-step-formula=\"4\">\n                                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g., x=4, x=-2\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\">\n                                        <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-300 text-sm\">Check</button>\n                                        <p class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-48 text-xs text-gray-500\"><strong>Result:</strong> State the final roots.</p>\n                                        <span class=\"feedback-icon\"></span>\n                                      </div>\n                                      <!-- Independent Practice Quiz Start -->\n                                      <div class=\"mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-dashed\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800\">Independent Practice</h4>\n                                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-3\">Now, solve this one on your own. Show your steps and provide the final answer.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"font-semibold\">Problem: <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x² + 3x - 10 = 0</code></p>\n                                        <div id=\"independent-quiz-formula\" class=\"mt-4 space-y-3\">\n                                          <div>\n                                            <label for=\"workings-formula\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Your Workings</label>\n                                            <textarea id=\"workings-formula\" rows=\"5\" class=\"w-full mt-1 p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\" placeholder=\"Show your steps here...\\n1. State a, b, c.\\n2. Calculate the discriminant.\\n3. Substitute into the formula.\\n4. State the final roots.\"></textarea>\n                                          </div>\n                                          <div>\n                                            <label for=\"final-answer-formula\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Final Answer</label>\n                                            <input type=\"text\" id=\"final-answer-formula\" placeholder=\"e.g., x=2, x=-5\" class=\"w-full mt-1 p-2 border rounded-md text-sm\">\n                                          </div>\n                                          <button id=\"check-independent-answer-formula\" class=\"w-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-blue-700 transition\">Check Final Answer</button>\n                                          <div id=\"independent-feedback-formula\" class=\"text-sm mt-2\"></div>\n                                        </div>\n                                      </div>\n                                      <!-- Independent Practice Quiz End -->\n                                    </div>\n                                  </div>\n                                  <!-- Interactive Quiz End -->\n                              </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Section 2: Forming Equations & Applications -->\n                        <div id=\"forming\" data-step=\"1\" class=\"learning-step bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm p-6 scroll-mt-24 hidden\">\n                            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\"><span class=\"mi -cogs text-green-500 mr-3\" data-mi=\"settings\">settings</span>Forming &amp; Applying Equations</h2>\n                            <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                              <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-gray-700\">Forming an Equation from Given Roots</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1\"><strong>The Big Idea:</strong> This is factorization in reverse. If you know the roots, you can rebuild the equation.</p>\n                                <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mt-2\">If the roots are <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">α</code> and <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">β</code>, the equation is <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x² - (sum of roots)x + (product of roots) = 0</code>. <br><strong>Example:</strong> If roots are 4 and -5, the Sum = -1 and the Product = -20. The equation is <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x² - (-1)x + (-20) = 0</code>, which simplifies to <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">x² + x - 20 = 0</code>.</p>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"pt-4 border-t\">\n                                <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-gray-700\">Application in Practical Problems</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1\"><strong>The Big Idea:</strong> Translate a real-world word problem into a quadratic equation to solve it.</p>\n                                <div class=\"mt-2 bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-3\">\n                                  <h4 class=\"font-semibold\">How to Translate Word Problems:</h4>\n                                  <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside pl-2 mt-1\">\n                                    <li><strong>Identify the unknown:</strong> Call it 'x' or another variable (like 'w' for width).</li>\n                                    <li><strong>Formulate the equation:</strong> Use the information given (e.g., area = length × width) to write an equation.</li>\n                                    <li><strong>Solve:</strong> Use one of the methods above to find the value of your unknown.</li>\n                                    <li><strong>Check your answer:</strong> Does the solution make sense in the real world? (e.g., length cannot be negative).</li>\n                                  </ul>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Section 3: Graphs -->\n                        <div id=\"graphs\" data-step=\"2\" class=\"learning-step bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm p-6 scroll-mt-24 hidden\">\n                            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\"><span class=\"mi -chart-line text-purple-500 mr-3\" data-mi=\"show_chart\">show_chart</span>Graphs of Quadratic Functions</h2>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Visualizing quadratic equations is a powerful way to understand them. When you plot <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100 text-sm\">y = ax² + bx + c</code>, you get a special U-shaped curve.</p>\n                            \n                            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                              <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-gray-700\">What is a Parabola?</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1\">A <strong>parabola</strong> is the name for the symmetrical, U-shaped curve created by a quadratic equation. It can open upwards (like a smile) if 'a' is positive, or downwards (like a frown) if 'a' is negative.</p>\n                              </div>\n\n                              <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-gray-700\">Drawing the Graph (Step-by-Step)</h3>\n                                <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside space-y-1 text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1\">\n                                  <li><strong>Create a Table of Values:</strong> Choose several x-values and plug them into the equation to find the corresponding y-values.</li>\n                                  <li><strong>Plot the Points:</strong> Mark these (x, y) coordinate pairs on your graph paper.</li>\n                                  <li><strong>Draw the Curve:</strong> Connect the points with a smooth, continuous curve to form your parabola.</li>\n                                </ol>\n                              </div>\n\n                              <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-gray-700\">Finding Roots from the Graph</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1\">The \"roots\" or \"solutions\" are simply the x-values where the parabola intersects the x-axis (the horizontal line). Think of it as where the curve hits the ground.</p>\n                                <div class=\"mt-3 bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg border\">\n                                  <div class=\"mt-4\">\n                                    <img src=\"/site/assets/images/mathematics/quadratic-roots.svg\" alt=\"Graph showing different types of quadratic roots: two real roots (crosses the x-axis at two points), one real root (touches the x-axis at one point), and no real roots (doesn't cross the x-axis)\" class=\"w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto border border-gray-200 rounded-lg\">\n                                  </div>\n                                  <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2\">\n                                    <strong>Interactive Demo:</strong> Drag the points A and B to change the equation and see how the roots change. \n                                    The x-coordinates where the parabola crosses the x-axis are the roots.\n                                  </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"bg-blue-50 p-3 rounded-lg mt-3\">\n                                  <p class=\"text-sm\"><strong>Key Points:</strong></p>\n                                  <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside text-sm space-y-1 mt-1\">\n                                    <li>A parabola can cross the x-axis 0, 1, or 2 times</li>\n                                    <li>Two crossings = two real roots (most common)</li>\n                                    <li>One crossing = one repeated root</li>\n                                    <li>No crossing = no real roots (complex roots)</li>\n                                  </ul>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n\n                              <div class=\"mt-6\">\n                                <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-gray-700\">Solving a System of Equations Graphically</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1\">To solve a pair of equations like <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">y = ax² + bx + c</code> (a curve) and <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">y = mx + k</code> (a straight line), draw both on the same graph. The points where the line and the parabola cross are the solutions.</p>\n                                <div class=\"mt-3 bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg border\">\n                                  <div class=\"mt-4\">\n                                    <img src=\"/site/assets/images/mathematics/quadratic-linear-intersection.svg\" alt=\"Graph showing a parabola intersecting with a straight line at two points, demonstrating the solution to a system of equations\" class=\"w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto border border-gray-200 rounded-lg\">\n                                  </div>\n                                  <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2\">\n                                    <strong>Interactive Demo:</strong> Drag points to modify both the parabola and the line. \n                                    The intersection points (if any) are the solutions to both equations.\n                                  </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"bg-blue-50 p-3 rounded-lg mt-3\">\n                                  <p class=\"text-sm\"><strong>Possible Outcomes:</strong></p>\n                                  <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside text-sm space-y-1 mt-1\">\n                                    <li>Two intersections = two solutions</li>\n                                    <li>One intersection = one solution (line touches the parabola)</li>\n                                    <li>No intersections = no solutions (line doesn't meet the parabola)</li>\n                                  </ul>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n\n                              <div class=\"mt-6\">\n                                <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-gray-700\">Finding the Gradient with a Tangent</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1\">A <strong>tangent</strong> is a straight line that \"just kisses\" the curve at a single point without crossing through it. The slope (or gradient) of this tangent line tells you how steep the curve is at that exact point.</p>\n                                <div class=\"mt-3 bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg border\">\n                                  <div class=\"mt-4\">\n                                    <img src=\"/site/assets/images/mathematics/quadratic-features.svg\" alt=\"Graph of a parabola with labeled key features: vertex, axis of symmetry, y-intercept, and direction of opening\" class=\"w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto border border-gray-200 rounded-lg\">\n                                  </div>\n                                  <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2\">\n                                    <strong>Interactive Demo:</strong> Move point A along the curve to see how the tangent line changes. \n                                    The slope of this line gives you the gradient of the curve at that point.\n                                  </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"bg-blue-50 p-3 rounded-lg mt-3\">\n                                  <p class=\"text-sm\"><strong>How to Find the Gradient:</strong></p>\n                                  <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside text-sm space-y-1 mt-1\">\n                                    <li>Draw the tangent line at your chosen point</li>\n                                    <li>Pick two points on your tangent line (not too close together)</li>\n                                    <li>Calculate the gradient using: <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">rise ÷ run</code> or <code class=\"font-mono bg-gray-100\">(y₂-y₁)/(x₂-x₁)</code></li>\n                                  </ol>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Resources Section -->\n                        <div id=\"resources\" data-step=\"3\" class=\"learning-step space-y-8 scroll-mt-24 hidden\">\n                            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Resources</h2>\n                            <!-- Interactive Solver -->\n                            <div class=\"bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm p-6\">\n                                <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Interactive Solver</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Enter the coefficients for <code class=\"font-mono\">ax² + bx + c = 0</code></p>\n                                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-4\">\n                                    <div>\n                                        <label for=\"coeff-a\" class=\"font-medium text-sm\">a</label>\n                                        <input type=\"number\" id=\"coeff-a\" value=\"1\" class=\"w-full mt-1 p-2 border rounded-md text-center\">\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div>\n                                        <label for=\"coeff-b\" class=\"font-medium text-sm\">b</label>\n                                        <input type=\"number\" id=\"coeff-b\" value=\"-5\" class=\"w-full mt-1 p-2 border rounded-md text-center\">\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div>\n                                        <label for=\"coeff-c\" class=\"font-medium text-sm\">c</label>\n                                        <input type=\"number\" id=\"coeff-c\" value=\"6\" class=\"w-full mt-1 p-2 border rounded-md text-center\">\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <button id=\"solve-btn\" class=\"w-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-blue-700 transition\">Solve</button>\n                                <div id=\"solver-output\" class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t\">\n                                    <!-- Output will be rendered here -->\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            \n                            <!-- Graph Visualizer -->\n                            <div class=\"bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm p-6\">\n                                <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Graph Visualizer</h3>\n                                <canvas id=\"quadratic-chart\" height=\"200\"></canvas>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div></div></div></main>\n\n        <!-- Footer Navigation -->\n        <footer class=\"bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm border-t border-gray-200 sticky bottom-0 z-40\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-3\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n                    <button id=\"prev-btn\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 text-gray-600 font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-200 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -arrow-left\" data-mi=\"arrow_back\">arrow_back</span>\n                        <span>Previous</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button id=\"next-btn\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\">\n                        <span>Next</span>\n                        <span class=\"mi -arrow-right\" data-mi=\"arrow_forward\">arrow_forward</span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n    </div>","bodyClass":"bg-gray-100 font-inter","bodyStyle":"","css":[],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":["#solving","#forming","#graphs","#resources"]}